ustify;}p.docx_18 span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}span.docx_21 {  color: #BBBBBB;}span.docx_23 {  color: #FFFFFF;  background-color: #526CFD;}span.docx_24 {  background-color: #F1F3FF;}span.docx_30 {  background-color: #F1F3FF;}span.docx_31 {  background-color: #F1F3FF;}span.docx_32 {  background-color: #F1F3FF;}span.docx_33 {  background-color: #F1F3FF;}span.docx_34 {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}span.docx_34 p {  text-align: left;}span.docx_34 {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}span.docx_35 {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  font-weight: bold;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}span.docx_35 {  font-weight: bold;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}span.docx_35 p {  text-align: left;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">全体本科生</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">各</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">教学单位</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">：</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">依照《西安电子科技大学本科课程重修实施办法（修订）》及本学期课程安排，现开展方案内</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">课程</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">重修选课</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">具体如下：</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">一、选课安排</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">本轮重修选课仅针对学生方案内课程尚不及格，且本学期正常开设的课程。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">选课时间为</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">17</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">11</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">：</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">0</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">0至</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">18</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日1</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">：00</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">选课</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">时</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">系统不判断</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">时间</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">冲突，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">但受课容量限制，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">请选课学生依据个人课表合理选课，尽可能避免冲突。</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt; background-color: yellow;">大学英语选修系列重修若无对应课程，请联系学院单独选课。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">以下课程单独开设重修班，重修学生只能选对应课程名及课序号，独立开课。其他课程重修,开放所有教学班，采取跟班重修方式（不得超过课容量）。</span></p><table class="docx_9" style="width: auto; table-layout: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><colgroup><col style="width: 168.55pt;"><col style="width: 109.3pt;"><col style="width: 136.95pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr class="firstRow" style="text-align: center;"><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">课程名</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">课序号</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;">备 注</td></tr><tr style="height: 29.3pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">高等数学A(</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">Ⅰ</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">)</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">52</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 20.8pt; text-align: center;"><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">大学英语</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">Ⅰ</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">)</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">102、103</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 24.75pt; text-align: center;"><td style="background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">大学英语</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">中级</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">Ⅰ</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">)</span></p></td><td style="background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">39</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 28.05pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">大学物理(II)</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">01</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td></tr><tr style="text-align: center;"><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">形势与政策(重修)</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">01</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 11pt; font-size: 11pt;">《形势与政策》II、Ⅳ、Ⅵ</span></p></td></tr><tr style="text-align: center;"><td style="background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">大学</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">体育</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">Ⅰ/II/III/IV/V/VI</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 9pt; font-size: 9pt;">）</span></p></td><td style="background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td><td style="background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 11pt; font-size: 11pt;">选对应等级</span></p></td></tr><tr style="text-align: center;"><td style="background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">概率论与数理统计</span></p></td><td style="background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">70</span></p></td><td style="background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">二、注意事项</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1.请</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">重修学生</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">严格按照规定时间和选课要求进行选课，各教学单位密切关注学生选课进度，提醒学生按时选课，确保所有学生知晓此次选课安排。</span></p><p style="min-height: 27pt; line-height: 27pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2.重修课程考核与当学期该课程考核一致，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">重修上课时间与初修课程上课时间冲突的，采取自修方式，免听重修课程（实验实践环节除外），</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">独立开设重修班的课程需按时到课。</span></p><p style="min-height: 27pt; line-height: 27pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3.重修成绩按实际考试成绩记载，标注“重修”。在排名计算、均分计算、绩点计算时，重修课程合格者按60分计算成绩。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">4.选课期间若因培养方案不同，无法正常重修，由学生提出申请，任课教师同意</span><span id="_GoBack"></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">后，由</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">所在</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学院（书院）办理，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">原则上不允许学生跨院修读专业课程</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，联系方式见附件。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">5.选课地址为:http://xk.xidian.edu.cn，使用统一身份认证帐号密码进行登录后进行选课。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">附件：各单位负责老师联系方式</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;本科生院</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 208pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">年</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">月1</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p></article></section><section class="docx"><article><p class="docx_6" style="border-width: 0pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; margin: 0pt; line-height: calc(100% + 20pt); text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">附件</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 24pt; font-size: 24pt;"> </span></p><p class="docx_6" style="border-width: 0pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; margin: 0pt; line-height: calc(100% + 20pt); text-indent: 0pt; text-align: center;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">各单位选课负责老师联系方式</span></p><table class="docx_8" style="width: 99.96%; table-layout: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><colgroup><col style="width: 199.7pt;"><col style="width: 76.9pt;"><col style="width: 138.55pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr class="firstRow" style="height: 28.35pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0pt 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">单位</span></p></td><td style="border-top: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0pt 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">联系人</span></p></td><td style="b